 <td class="right">XX XX XX</td>
 </tr>
</table>


<table style="direction: rtl;">
  <tr>
  <td class="right">XX XX XX</td>
  <td class="left">XX</td>
  </tr>
</table>
```

Any pointers on where to troubleshoot?
